# there is nothing meaningful left to assert once the credentials are removed.
# The parts that do not need a cloud account — auth-config validation, the
# aws_sigv4 + multipart rejection — are covered by the server unit suite
# (rest/tools, lib/toolAuth).
call-aws-and-gcp-apis-from-an-agent
